  "selection": "Per target the best validation score wins (V: R2, O5: log loss, D10: Brier). Candidates: numbers only, and numbers and/or images from every pretrained backbone, frozen or fine-tuned (Stage 5F), on equal terms. A model that uses chart images is chosen only if its validation gain over the best numbers-only model has a month-block 95% CI that excludes 0.",
